What about only four different types of water: Plain, lawful, neutral 
and chaotic. Aligned water (e.g. lawful) would be holy water for 
coaligned characters (lawfuls) and unholy water for everbody else 
(neutrals and chaotics).

Praying on an altar with plain water on it results in water with the 
same alignment as the altar. Blessing water makes coaligned water, of 
course. Cursing it results in random "unholy" water, i.e. water of a 
different alignment.

